<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">General Ledger & Financial Control</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            The unbreakable core of your financial ecosystem, providing the rigorous control and 
            transparency required for professional enterprise management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Comprehensive Financial Backbone</h2>
        <p>
            The General Ledger records every economic event within your organization, linking 
            operational transactions from all ERP modules to their final financial impact. 
            Native integration ensures that every debit and credit is posted automatically 
            based on predefined accounting rules, eliminating manual re-entry and ensuring 
            the absolute integrity of your financial statements (Income Statement, Balance 
            Sheet, Cash Flow).
        </p>
        <p>
            A hierarchical chart of accounts provides the flexibility to model complex 
            corporate structures, supporting multi-departmental and multi-entity 
            reporting while maintaining a unified group-level view.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">IFRS Compliance and Multi-Currency Posting</h2>
        <p>
            Engineered for international standards, our General Ledger supports IFRS and IAS reporting 
            requirements natively. Robust multi-currency capabilities allow for transactions to 
            be posted in any currency, with automated conversion to the organizational 
            functional currency using daily exchange rate tables. This is especially 
            critical for organizations operating in Zimbabwe's dual-currency multi-tender 
            environment.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated recurring journals for depreciation, prepayments, and accruals ensure that 
            period-end adjustments are processed with mechanical precision, shortening the 
            time required for financial close.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Immutable Auditability and Governance</h2>
        <p>
            Financial integrity is underpinned by an immutable audit trail that records every 
            creation, edit, or reversal of a journal entry, along with the user timestamp 
            and original source transaction. Lock-down controls for closed periods 
            prevent unauthorized back-dating of entries, ensuring compliance with 
            corporate governance standards and external audit requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
            Inter-company elimination and consolidation tools support complex group 
            structures, allowing for the rapid generation of group-level statements 
            while preserving the detail of individual business unit performance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

